EasyNav Gradients
Copyright 2026 Marvin Pancracio Manso

This software was adapted from the EasyNav NavMap A* planner:
https://github.com/EasyNavigation/easynav_plugins

It integrates with EasyNavigation and NavMap:
https://github.com/EasyNavigation/EasyNavigation
https://github.com/EasyNavigation/NavMap

Modifications include potential propagation, gradient estimation and descent,
cache management, and Elastic Band smoothing.

